{
  "name": "showcase/catch-up-rich",
  "priority": 1,
  "trigger": {
    "type": "message",
    "channel": {
      "type": "websocket",
      "initiatingRequestPattern": {
        "url": "/ws"
      }
    },
    "message": {
      "body": {
        "and": [
          {
            "matchesJsonPath": {
              "expression": "$.method",
              "equalTo": "session.catchUp"
            }
          },
          {
            "matchesJsonPath": {
              "expression": "$.params.sessionId",
              "equalTo": "rich"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"res\",\"id\":\"{{jsonPath message.body '$.id'}}\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{}}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"session.update\",\"payload\":{\"agentId\":\"e2e\",\"sessionId\":\"rich\",\"change\":{\"type\":\"reset\",\"firstSeq\":0}},\"seq\":1}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"session.update\",\"payload\":{\"agentId\":\"e2e\",\"sessionId\":\"rich\",\"change\":{\"type\":\"entry\",\"seq\":0,\"entry\":{\"type\":\"user\",\"text\":\"Draft the 2.0 release notes from this changelog.\",\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"changelog\",\"name\":\"CHANGELOG-2.0.pdf\",\"mimeType\":\"application/pdf\",\"size\":284311}]}}},\"seq\":2}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"session.update\",\"payload\":{\"agentId\":\"e2e\",\"sessionId\":\"rich\",\"change\":{\"type\":\"entry\",\"seq\":1,\"entry\":{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"text\":\"## Release notes draft\\n\\nHere's the **2.0** summary, grouped by area:\\n\\n1. Sync is now *incremental*\\n2. Offline edits merge without prompts\\n3. New `kinuvo pair` command\\n\\n| Area | Change | Risk |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Sync | Incremental uploads | Medium |\\n| CLI | `pair` and `unpair` | Low |\\n| Mobile | Voice chat | Low |\\n\\nRun the migration with:\\n\\n```sh\\nkinuvo migrate --from 1.9 --dry-run\\nkinuvo migrate --from 1.9\\n```\\n\\n- Inline code like `SessionStatus.Waiting` stays readable\\n- Nested items:\\n  - keep their indent\\n  - and wrap long lines without breaking the layout of the list\",\"messageId\":\"m-notes\"}}},\"seq\":3}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"session.update\",\"payload\":{\"agentId\":\"e2e\",\"sessionId\":\"rich\",\"change\":{\"type\":\"entry\",\"seq\":2,\"entry\":{\"type\":\"user\",\"text\":\"Check the migration script, the docs site and the release branch, then write the migration guide.\"}}},\"seq\":4}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"session.update\",\"payload\":{\"agentId\":\"e2e\",\"sessionId\":\"rich\",\"change\":{\"type\":\"entry\",\"seq\":3,\"entry\":{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"id\":\"t-read\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"args\":\"{\\\"path\\\": \\\"scripts/migrate.sh\\\"}\"}}},\"seq\":5}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"session.update\",\"payload\":{\"agentId\":\"e2e\",\"sessionId\":\"rich\",\"change\":{\"type\":\"entry\",\"seq\":4,\"entry\":{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"id\":\"t-read\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"output\":\"#!/bin/sh\\nkinuvo migrate \\\"$@\\\"\"}}},\"seq\":6}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "send",
      "channelTarget": {
        "type": "originating"
      },
      "message": {
        "body": {
          "data": "{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"session.update\",\"payload\":{\"agentId\":\"e2e\",\"sessionId\":\"rich\",\"change\":{\"type\":\"entry\",\"seq\":5,\"entry\":{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"id\":\"t-fetch\",\"name\":\"web_fetch\",\"args\":\"{\\\"url\\\": \\\"https://docs.example.com/2.0\\\"}\"}}},\"seq\":7}"
